keywords:
  - large language model
  - benchmark
  - Taiwan
  - GSAT
  - CAP
  - 1-bit
abstract: >-
  A 360,607-bit static function that answers every officially-keyed item of Taiwan's
  General Scholastic Ability Test (1994–2026), the Comprehensive Assessment Program
  for Junior High School Students (2013–2026) and a 1,000-item Taiwanese-values
  benchmark with 100% accuracy, in a web browser, without a GPU.
